### Create an order (repeat this request: same key, same body -> 200 + Idempotent-Replayed)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-1

{"customerId":"cust-42","lines":[{"sku":"BOOK-1","description":"Exercise book","quantity":2,"unitPrice":"10.00"},{"sku":"PEN-1","description":"Pen","quantity":3,"unitPrice":"4.50"}]}

### Same key, different body -> 422
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-1

{"customerId":"cust-42","lines":[{"sku":"BOOK-1","description":"Exercise book","quantity":5,"unitPrice":"10.00"}]}

### Get it (replace the id); the ETag header is the version
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/{{id}}

### Replace lines on a draft, with the version from the ETag
PUT http://localhost:8080/orders/{{id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "0"

{"lines":[{"sku":"RULER-1","description":"Ruler","quantity":1,"unitPrice":"25.00"}]}

### Same request again: If-Match "0" is now stale -> 412
PUT http://localhost:8080/orders/{{id}}/lines
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "0"

{"lines":[{"sku":"RULER-1","description":"Ruler","quantity":1,"unitPrice":"99.00"}]}

### Lifecycle
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/{{id}}/confirm
###
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/{{id}}/fulfil
### Not allowed from FULFILLED -> 409 naming the current status
POST http://localhost:8080/orders/{{id}}/cancel

### List, filtered and paged
GET http://localhost:8080/orders?customerId=cust-42&status=FULFILLED&page=0&size=20
